&lt;p>Preference will be given to student applicants in one or more of the following categories:&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>TQC 2027 &amp; TQC 2028</title><link>https://tqc-conference.org/2026/2027/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tqc-conference.org/2026/2027/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="tqc-2027">TQC 2027&lt;/h2>
