&lt;h3 id="conference-venue">Conference Venue&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>TQC 2026 will take place at the &lt;strong>Delta Hotels by Marriott Sherbrooke Conference Centre&lt;/strong>, located in the heart of Sherbrooke (a traditional and unceded land of the W8banaki Nation, known as Ndakina).&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>